---
description: Enforce security, performance, indexing, and edge-case review dimensions
alwaysApply: true
---

Always consider:
- OWASP-style security risks
- authentication and authorization implications
- input validation and injection risks
- secrets handling
- abuse prevention and rate limiting where relevant
- performance and scaling implications
- hot query paths and indexing implications
- edge cases and failure modes
- observability and operational impact where relevant
